  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Хотите иметь все возможные предметы из изумруда?</strong></span></h2>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Тогда этот мод создан именно для вас.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Предметы:</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Изумрудный меч.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Изумрудная кирка</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Изумрудный топор.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Изумрудная лопата.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Изумрудная мотыга.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Изумрудная броня.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Изумрудные ножницы.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Изумрудные кирпичи.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Рецепты:</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/332/900/310/172/recipe_1.png\" width=\"310\" height=\"135\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/332/901/310/172/immagine-2021-01-10-195710.png\" width=\"310\" height=\"147\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/332/902/310/172/immagine-2021-01-10-195749.png\" width=\"310\" height=\"145\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/332/903/310/172/immagine-2021-01-10-195835.png\" width=\"310\" height=\"145\"></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/332/904/310/172/immagine-2021-01-10-195909.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"148\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/332/905/310/172/immagine-2021-01-10-195935.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"147\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/332/906/310/172/immagine-2021-01-10-200006.png\"></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/332/907/310/172/immagine-2021-01-10-200040.png\"></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/332/908/310/172/immagine-2021-01-10-200114.png\"></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/332/909/310/172/immagine-2021-01-10-200151.png\"></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/332/910/310/172/immagine-2021-01-10-200222.png\"></span></div>",
